uted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226680/extras/86327cc519a876bc60cf7310f80c4ff0.poster.avif?t=1753702384\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226680/extras/86327cc519a876bc60cf7310f80c4ff0.webm?t=1753702384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226680/extras/86327cc519a876bc60cf7310f80c4ff0.mp4?t=1753702384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
